# Overrides for Sphinx's own Japanese UI strings.
#
# Only the admonition labels are overridden, and only to leave them in English.
# Sphinx translates them to 注釈 / 警告 / ヒント, which reads heavier than the
# surrounding prose; English labels are the convention in Japanese technical
# writing and keep these boxes visually quiet. Every other Sphinx string
# (search, navigation, index) keeps its Japanese translation.
#
# Sphinx compiles this to sphinx.mo automatically when it is out of date, so
# there is nothing to run by hand.
